SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">일 청년들의 일자리 부족현상과 중소기업의 구인난 미스매칭을 완화하고 및 중소기업 취업청년들의 주거비용을 경감하기 위하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">「</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">중소기업 취업청년 전월세 임차보증금 융자사업</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">을 발표한 바 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">이번 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">7.30.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">부터 위 융자사업의 임차보증금 한도 및 지원대상을 아래와 같이 확대하였음을 알려드립니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">▷ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">보증금 및 대출한도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">임차보증금 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">억원 이하 주택에 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">50</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">백만원까지 지원</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">▷ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">재직기준 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">前 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">직장 고용형태 및 근무기관과 무관하게 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">‘17.12.1 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">이후 중소기업에 취업 또는 중진공 신기보 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 지원받은 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">만 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">34</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">세 이하 청년</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"v\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" /--><v:shapetype id=\"_x0000_t75\" coordsize=\"21600,21600\" o:spt=\"75\" o:preferrelative=\"t\" path=\"m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe\" filled=\"f\" stroked=\"f\"><v:stroke joinstyle=\"miter\"></v:stroke><v:formulas><v:f eqn=\"if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum @0 1 0\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum 0 0 @1\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @2 1 2\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelWidth\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelHeight\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum @0 0 1\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @6 1 2\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelWidth\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum @8 21600 0\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelHeight\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum @10 21600 0\"></v:f></v:formulas><v:path o:extrusionok=\"f\" gradientshapeok=\"t\" o:connecttype=\"rect\"></v:path><o:lock v:ext=\"edit\" aspectratio=\"t\"></o:lock></v:shapetype>&nbsp;</p></span><img style=\"HEIGHT: 959px; WIDTH: 713px\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/b86066ba-093f-4ab8-86d8-19f2e888ed90.jpg\" width=\"2633\" height=\"3661\"> \n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
